                    <tr><th scope="row">Gompertz (Fmax)</th><td>k = 0.249 · g = 3.08 · Fmax = 91.8</td><td>0.969</td><td>70.9</td><td>&lt; 0.001</td><td>5.1</td><td>11.1</td><td>Fmax below the observed 95 %: the plateau estimate contradicts the data.</td></tr>
